basis `1` for both. The raw ideal is nonunit; empty, point, and lift controls
all pass. Foreground wall time was 1:03.83 and peak RSS 520,888 KiB.

This reproduces the Appendix-II kill in characteristic zero, stronger than the
frozen modular calibration. The control's ordered Jacobian is the negative of
the main engine orientation; localization of the otherwise free nonzero scalar
