## No Unlicensed Specialization

`CONFIRMED[NO-UNLICENSED-SPECIALIZATION]`.

The gauge `P=y^3(y-x)^8` only fixes the two lines at infinity and their
placement.  The approximate-root Tschirnhausen omissions are characteristic
zero normalizations.  The split datum `delta=5/2`, `p=pi(pi^2-c)`, `c!=0`,
and the reduced `q1` ODE are imported branch hypotheses from the charged
classification; they are not extra numerical cuts.  The chart's `y=0` minor
line is the declared branch place.  No value is substituted for `u`, `v`,
`c`, or any outer coordinate.  The contradiction appears as the integer `64`
before localization.

